gle Flow handoff is tested and I approve it.\n- Screen 08's reconstruction **method** is approved, but **Screen 08 itself is not yet approved**; none of the five gameplay screens is final until I personally approve it.\n- Do not mistake a pixel-within-tolerance percentage for a guarantee of perceptual quality or successful moving 3D gameplay.\n\n## 2. ONE GitHub repository; lead branch and six specialist branches\n\n**Repository:** https://github.com/josiahscalia5-dev/rainbow-\n\n**LEAD BRANCH FROM MY ACCOUNT THAT RAN OUT:** `ccr-c0235034-ks6sx3`\n\nConnect this ONE repository to the new Claude account. It contains all branches. **Do not ask me to connect seven separate repositories** and do not create a brand-new game.\n\nThese seven branch tips were independently read from GitHub on **2026-11-17**, for recovery. Some were autosaves and may already have newer commits by the time you receive this file:\n\n| Role | Existing source branch | Verified checkpoint SHA (NOT a pinned final tip) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Lead Claudia | `ccr-c0235034-ks6sx3` | `ed23f9e50dcae1891eb08d6b54c51f680c7f64ff` |\n| Screen 04 — Five Arrows | `claude/rainbow-s04-match-c3` | `d1e422faff67a37f837566301fb8abff0bac98db` |\n| Screen 05 — Flow Into the Current | `claude/rainbow-s05-match-c3` | `ebaf6cac71812ad5c00a9088ba48b6febdb42b2b` |\n| Screen 06 — Rinse Arch | `claude/rainbow-s06-match-c3` | `c088718bb9e3374583238f4ee93f25bdee600065` |\n| Screen 07 — Washer Tube | `claude/rainbow-s07-match-c3` | `a5d2b392c4e88e020e21b228d3cb5d2a7d107a35` |\n| Screen 08 — Benny artist | `claude/rainbow-s08-benny08-bake-c3` | `c64ff28bcc8a14c41f661c8aa9690b47f1b7a903` |\n| Screen 08 — Camera/obstructions | `claude/rainbow-s08-camclear-c3` | `c03f391cee241eb87641ceb2de47c1050382e965` |\n\nPrior lead recovery branches, **do not overwrite**:\n\n- `ccr-5495e9c4-g0apvl`\n- `ccr-d4240b15-rl1i72`\n- `ccr-9c4a8ad6-xovgsx`\n\nPrior specialist branches ending `-c2` and original workstream branches are historical checkpoi